;; (default-menu rung, evidenced from that file's own call site: a
;; single int arg, return read at offset 184 by trsq->continue-point).
;; vehicle-idx-from-level-name (already active, given a real
;; signature) is omitted too: its own dynamic net-vehicle array indexing
